WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Did they ever reply?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.450
When should you follow up?

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.550
What did you even send them?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.768
Every application has a stage, a next step, and a day to follow up.

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:19.950
Switch to a table when you like.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.538
Applications with no news for a few weeks are marked quiet,

00:00:26.538 --> 00:00:28.270
with a check-in to send.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.930
jobwatch only suggests.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.705
Add your follow-ups and interviews to your own calendar.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.810
The Interviews tab lists what's coming up, today's first.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.050
Press the slash key, type a name, and see everything about that company.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.552
Each application keeps what you sent: the resume, your answers,

00:00:48.552 --> 00:00:50.315
and the posting as it read.
